      "text": "Breakfast at the hotel. At the agreed time, transfer to El Dorado International Airport to take the flight (not included) to Pereira. Upon arrival, reception at Matecaña International Airport and transfer to the hotel for check-in.\n\nAt the agreed time, the tour will start towards one of the coffee farms in the region. Upon arrival at the designated farm, the interactive tour will begin with a local expert, guiding tourists through beautiful specialty coffee plantations and explaining the coffee process from planting, selective manual harvesting, and pulp removal.\n\nThe tour includes several stops at viewpoints where you can appreciate the beautiful landscape and natural surroundings. Finally, the tour covers the innovative coffee drying process and proceeds to the processing plant, milling, and roasting; concluding at the main house with a coffee tasting and barista demonstration to savor a cup of the world's best coffee. Return to the hotel and accommodation.\n\nDuration: Approximately 5 hours\n\nIncludes: Private transportation, professional Spanish-speaking tour guide, interactive coffee process, assistance from expert staff at the estate (Coffee Farm or Hacienda Morelia depending on availability).\n\nOptional Supplement: Lunch: 20 USD per person"
    },
